ti\\\",\\\"item\\\":18,\\\"text\\\":\\\"A gate that inspects source text is additionally attacked by a mutant that PRESERVES the searched-for token and changes behavior, and the mutant harness executes the behavioral suite, not only the static checker.\\\"}}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1033,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 259,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
